### REST
```
curl -X PATCH \
-H "Authorization: Bearer $(gcloud auth print-access-token)" \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-H "X-Goog-User-Project: PROJECT_ID" \
"https://ENDPOINT_LOCATION-discoveryengine.googleapis.com/v1alpha/projects/PROJECT_ID?updateMask=customerProvidedConfig.notebooklmConfig.observabilityConfig" \
-d '{
"customerProvidedConfig": {
"notebooklmConfig": {
"observabilityConfig": {
"observabilityEnabled": true,
"sensitiveLoggingEnabled": true
}
}
}
}'
```
Replace the following:
- `ENDPOINT_LOCATION`: the multi-region for your API request. Specify one of the following values: For more information, see [Specify a multi-region for your data store](https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini/enterprise/docs/locations#specify_a_multi-region_for_your_data_store).
- `us` for the US multi-region
- `eu` for the EU multi-region
- `global` for the Global location
- `PROJECT_ID`: the ID of your project.
